    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the flash game 'Strengthening Sword', this game was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is the same as the 3D Vampire Survival genre, but other content is point-and-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has nothing but 2000 gold that was initially given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend you buy a wood sword with that sword, because you have to kill the monster to get the item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the item, you can build a sword that is stronger than a wood sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a sword, you can go to the store and sell it. Weapons only, material items cannot be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about how to make gold and survive to the end by monsters for 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Player - WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack Key - Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Item - Drag and Drop</p>",
